@startuml P210_issue_vc_proxy_simple_ko

'- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -
' 설정
'- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -
'=== Header and Footer ===
header OPEN-DID 기술 규격
footer
  	Page %page% of %lastpage% at %date("yyyy-MM-dd hh:mm:ss")
end footer

'=== 제목 ===
title
	<size:25>P210 : VC 발급 (Proxy 모드)</size>
end title

'=== 옵션 ===
autonumber "<b>(#)</b>"

'=== Participants ===
<style>
participant {
  Padding 20
}
</style>
skinparam BoxPadding 20
skinparam MaxMessageSize 500
skinparam MinClassWidth 80


actor USER

box 모바일 #OldLace
    participant "**월렛**" as WALLET <<Wallet>> #WhiteSmoke
    participant "**인가앱**" as CA <<App>> #WhiteSmoke
end box

box 인가앱 사업자 #AliceBlue
    participant "**CAS**" as CAS <<WAS>> #WhiteSmoke
    participant "**Proxy**" as PROXY <<Server>> #WhiteSmoke
end box

box TAS서버 #AliceBlue
    participant "**TAS**" as TAS <<WAS>> #WhiteSmoke
end box

box 발급서버 #AliceBlue
    participant "**ISSUER**" as ISSUER <<WAS>> #WhiteSmoke
end box

box 신뢰저장소
    participant "**blockchain**" as BC <<Storage>> #WhiteSmoke
end box


'- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -
' 내용
'- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -
|||

== VC Plan 목록 조회 ==
CA -> TAS++: VC Plan 목록 요청
activate CA
return VC Plan 목록
CA -> CA: issuanceMode = PROXY 인 VC Plan 선택

rnote over CA, CAS
    (사전 조건) 인가앱은 KYC 등으로 확인한 사용자 정보를
    CAS에 미리 등록한다 (userId ↔ pii).
end rnote

== P210-1 : VC 발급 시작 요청 ==
CA -> PROXY++: Propose Issue VC
    PROXY -> ISSUER++: Inspect Propose
    return {txId, refId}
return {txId, refId}

== P210-2 : VC 발급 프로파일 요청 ==
CA -> PROXY++: Request Issue Profile {txId, userId}
    PROXY -> ISSUER++: Generate Profile (Proxy) {txId, userId}
        ISSUER -> CAS++: Retrieve PII {userId}
        return {pii}
        ISSUER -> ISSUER: 발급 대상 사용자 식별
        ISSUER -> ISSUER: Issue Profile 생성
        opt ZKP Credential 포함
            ISSUER -> ISSUER: ZKP Credential Offer 생성
        end
        ISSUER -> ISSUER: authNonce = issuerNonce
    return {txId, profile, authNonce}
return {txId, profile, authNonce}

== P210-3 : 월렛 토큰 생성 ==
rnote across #white
    월렛 토큰 생성 과정은 본 규격에서 다루지 않음
    `issue_wallet_token_simple` 참고
    Proxy 모드에서는 TAS와의 ECDH 및 서버토큰 발급 단계를 수행하지 않는다.
end note

== P210-4 : VC 발급 요청 ==
CA -> WALLET++: VC 발급 요청
    WALLET -> WALLET: didAuth {Holder DID, authNonce} 생성 및 서명
    WALLET -> WALLET: reqVc 생성 및 E2E 암호화
    opt ZKP 포함
        WALLET -> WALLET: credentialRequest 생성, reqVc에 포함
    end
    WALLET -> PROXY++: Request Issue VC {txId, didAuth, accE2e, encReqVc}
        PROXY -> ISSUER++: Issue VC (Proxy)
            ISSUER <-> BC: Holder DID Doc 조회 / 응답
            ISSUER -> ISSUER: didAuth 서명 및 authNonce 검증
            ISSUER -> ISSUER: encReqVc 복호화 및 IssueProfile 대비 검증
            ISSUER -> ISSUER: vc: VC 발급 or 재발급
            opt VC 재발급의 경우
                ISSUER -> BC: 기존 VC 폐기 요청
            end
            opt ZKP 포함
                ISSUER -> ISSUER: credential: ZKP Credential 발급
            end
            ISSUER -> BC: VC Meta 등록
            ISSUER -> ISSUER: VC<sub>enc</sub> = credInfo E2E 암호화
        return VC<sub>enc</sub> 응답
    return VC<sub>enc</sub> 응답
    WALLET -> WALLET: credInfo = VC<sub>enc</sub> E2E 복호화
    WALLET -> WALLET: VC 저장
return {vcId}

== P210-5 : 발급 완료 응답 ==
CA -> PROXY++: Confirm Issue VC {txId, vcId}
    PROXY -> ISSUER++: Complete VC {txId, vcId}
    return {txId}
return {txId}
deactivate CA

@enduml
